{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kholin Echo Alpha 1.0 version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is a vertical slice of the game, and contains all the core features that you will find later on in the final game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to play the full loop, from starting in your home planet to reach the limit of the universe when escaping the Oblivion Wave. You can repeat the run and improve sending energy to your home planet and getting new upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also you will see those main elements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero main mechanics: Move, Dash, Fly, Aim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landing with spaceship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect energy resources to refill the spaceship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liftoff to next planet</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm main weapon: Gunshot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rune Temple: Upgrade your arm weapon to improve the shoot (Twin, Repeat, Spread)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Temple: Get upgrades to improve main hero (resources break, kill heals, velocity, crit, dodge...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy Antenna: Send energy to your home planet to get permanent upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies: Bite, Shoot, Flying, Roll, Nest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps: Spikes, Laser, Explode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Events: Meteors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First final boss: Big worm</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072750?t=1760032650","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072750?t=1760032650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072750/d7fc5dc22f5d44eed5a9c7ab262f31e9066282b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760032650","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072750/d7fc5dc22f5d44eed5a9c7ab262f31e9066282b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760032650","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kholin Echo Alpha 1.0 version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is a vertical slice of the game, and contains all the core features that you will find later on in the final game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to play the full loop, from starting in your home planet to reach the limit of the universe when escaping the Oblivion Wave. You can repeat the run and improve sending energy to your home planet and getting new upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also you will see those main elements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero main mechanics: Move, Dash, Fly, Aim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landing with spaceship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect energy resources to refill the spaceship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liftoff to next planet</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm main weapon: Gunshot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rune Temple: Upgrade your arm weapon to improve the shoot (Twin, Repeat, Spread)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Temple: Get upgrades to improve main hero (resources break, kill heals, velocity, crit, dodge...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy Antenna: Send energy to your home planet to get permanent upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies: Bite, Shoot, Flying, Roll, Nest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps: Spikes, Laser, Explode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Events: Meteors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First final boss: Big worm</p></li></ul>","developers":["Insert Disk"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3694550","name":"Kholin Echo"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072750/4b61e72e45892c18919918bb859be0a99df55637/header.jpg?t=1760032650","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4072750/1137354740/3d6ba29ba0d9967f3fc4cb695f77d9014464b99a/1759413080/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760032648","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4072750/1137354740/3d6ba29ba0d9967f3fc4cb695f77d9014464b99a/1759413080/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760032648","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4072750/1137354740/3d6ba29ba0d9967f3fc4cb695f77d9014464b99a/1759413080/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760032648","id":257210806,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257210806/movie480.mp4?t=1760032648","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257210806/movie_max.mp4?t=1760032648"},"name":"Alpha 1.0 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257210806/ed408ae3c5150c6191cad3ea21dff96a0b79ad03/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760032648","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257210806/movie480.webm?t=1760032648","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257210806/movie_max.webm?t=1760032648"}}],"name":"Kholin Echo Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 520 / NVIDIA GT 710</li></ul>"},